<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head') %>

</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main>

<section class="sh-page-hero" aria-label="Services hero">
  <div class="sh-container">
    <h1>Our Services</h1>
    <p>Comprehensive engineering and manufacturing solutions tailored to your industry needs.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sh-section" aria-labelledby="cap-detail-heading">
  <div class="sh-container">
    <div class="sh-section-title">
      <h2 id="cap-detail-heading">Manufacturing Capabilities</h2>
      <p>Four core technologies, infinite possibilities for your components.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-12 mb-4">
        <article class="sh-card sh-animate">
          <div class="sh-flex sh-gap-6">
            <div class="sh-service__icon" style="width:64px;height:64px;font-size:28px;"><i class="icofont-cube"></i></div>
            <div>
              <h3 style="margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-3);">3D Printing</h3>
              <p>Transform digital designs into physical objects layer by layer. Ideal for rapid prototyping, complex geometries, custom tooling, and low-volume production runs. We work with plastics, resins, and metals to match your application requirements.</p>
              <p class="sh-text-small sh-mt-4"><strong>Best for:</strong> Prototypes, custom fixtures, intricate parts, low-volume runs</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-12 mb-4">
        <article class="sh-card sh-animate">
          <div class="sh-flex sh-gap-6">
            <div class="sh-service__icon" style="width:64px;height:64px;font-size:28px;"><i class="icofont-flash"></i></div>
            <div>
              <h3 style="margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-3);">Laser Cutting</h3>
              <p>High-precision cutting using focused laser beams for clean, burr-free edges. Capable of cutting sheet metal, acrylic, wood, and composites with tolerances down to ±0.1mm. Perfect for detailed patterns and consistent repeatability.</p>
              <p class="sh-text-small sh-mt-4"><strong>Best for:</strong> Sheet metal parts, signage, intricate patterns, rapid turnaround</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-12 mb-4">
        <article class="sh-card sh-animate">
          <div class="sh-flex sh-gap-6">
            <div class="sh-service__icon" style="width:64px;height:64px;font-size:28px;"><i class="icofont-settings"></i></div>
            <div>
              <h3 style="margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-3);">CNC Punching</h3>
              <p>Computer-controlled punching for high-speed, repeatable hole patterns, slots, and formed features in sheet metal. Ideal for medium to high-volume production where consistency and speed are critical.</p>
              <p class="sh-text-small sh-mt-4"><strong>Best for:</strong> Enclosures, brackets, panels, medium-volume production</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-12 mb-4">
        <article class="sh-card sh-animate">
          <div class="sh-flex sh-gap-6">
            <div class="sh-service__icon" style="width:64px;height:64px;font-size:28px;"><i class="icofont-fire-burn"></i></div>
            <div>
              <h3 style="margin-bottom:var(--sh-space-3);">Plasma Cutting</h3>
              <p>High-velocity plasma arc cutting for thick steel, stainless steel, and aluminum plates. Capable of cutting material up to 50mm thick with excellent speed, making it ideal for structural and heavy-duty fabrication.</p>
              <p class="sh-text-small sh-mt-4"><strong>Best for:</strong> Heavy plates, structural components, industrial fabrication</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sh-section" style="background:var(--sh-surface);" aria-labelledby="eng-heading">
  <div class="sh-container">
    <div class="sh-section-title">
      <h2 id="eng-heading">Engineering Services</h2>
      <p>Beyond manufacturing — complete engineering support for your projects.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-12 mb-4">
        <article class="sh-service sh-animate">
          <div class="sh-service__icon"><i class="icofont-gear"></i></div>
          <div><h4>Manufacturing</h4><p>End-to-end fabrication services from raw material to finished component. We handle material sourcing, machining, finishing, assembly, and quality control.</p></div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-12 mb-4">
        <article class="sh-service sh-animate">
          <div class="sh-service__icon"><i class="icofont-brainstorming"></i></div>
          <div><h4>Engineering Consultancy</h4><p>Expert guidance on design optimization, material selection, process planning, and cost reduction. We help you make informed decisions before committing to production.</p></div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-12 mb-4">
        <article class="sh-service sh-animate">
          <div class="sh-service__icon"><i class="icofont-read-book"></i></div>
          <div><h4>Research & Development</h4><p>Collaborative product development from concept through prototype to production. We validate designs with simulation, prototyping, and testing before full-scale manufacturing.</p></div>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-12 mb-4">
        <article class="sh-service sh-animate">
          <div class="sh-service__icon"><i class="icofont-graduate"></i></div>
          <div><h4>Training & Education</h4><p>Hands-on technical training in CAD/CAM software, manufacturing processes, and engineering best practices for individuals and organizations.</p></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sh-section" aria-labelledby="soft-heading">
  <div class="sh-container">
    <div class="sh-section-title">
      <h2 id="soft-heading">Our Software Stack</h2>
      <p>Industry-standard tools that ensure precision from design to production.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sh-grid sh-grid--5">
      <div class="sh-card sh-text-center sh-animate"><h4 style="color:var(--sh-brand);">SolidWorks</h4><p class="sh-text-small">3D CAD modeling, assembly design, and detailed engineering drawings.</p></div>
      <div class="sh-card sh-text-center sh-animate"><h4 style="color:var(--sh-brand);">AutoCAD</h4><p class="sh-text-small">2D drafting, layout planning, and technical documentation.</p></div>
      <div class="sh-card sh-text-center sh-animate"><h4 style="color:var(--sh-brand);">ANSYS</h4><p class="sh-text-small">Finite element analysis for stress, thermal, and structural validation.</p></div>
      <div class="sh-card sh-text-center sh-animate"><h4 style="color:var(--sh-brand);">CNCKAD</h4><p class="sh-text-small">CNC punching and cutting machine programming and nesting.</p></div>
      <div class="sh-card sh-text-center sh-animate"><h4 style="color:var(--sh-brand);">Bodor Laser</h4><p class="sh-text-small">Laser cutting control, path optimization, and parameter management.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sh-cta">
  <div class="sh-container">
    <h2>Not Sure Which Service You Need?</h2>
    <p>Our engineers can assess your project and recommend the most cost-effective manufacturing approach. No obligation, just expert advice.</p>
    <div class="sh-cta__actions">
      <a href="/request-consultation" class="sh-btn sh-btn--primary sh-btn--lg">Request a Consultation</a>
      <a href="/contact" class="sh-btn sh-btn--ghost sh-btn--lg">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
<%- include('partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
